WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.520
Do you want to give people a free sample?

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.360
You pick how many free chats they get, up to 20.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.260
Or make the whole plugin free.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.860
Example, give five free chats, then they pay.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.840
How many free chats do you want to give?

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.040
Zero to 20, or type free to make it free.
